Z||000000||Master_Sushi||10-14-2001||10:33 AM||||The guy that bought my fiero on ebay came to pick it up yesterday afternoon. He seemd like a nice guy! He told me how it was in beautifull shap, and it looked better then his brand new 2000 something or other car. Even this picture I post dosent show how nice my car was. This was as mint as a fiero will come. Peobably not far off from the $20,000 new ones you see on ebay every once and a while.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SAVE0052.jpg"> <P>Its funny, I never noteced how pretty it was until I saw the guy driving it away. I could have cried when he waved through the sunroof and beeped at me when he drove off!<P>Hell be driving it cross country in a few days I beleave. So if someone sees it please tell me! I'd be very interested. He is on the internet so I will probably email him a link to the forum. He lived around huston I beleave. So be on the lookout for a nice white 88 coupe in the Texas area! ||||reg||9
